1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
Pain travels through families until someone is ready to feel it.

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,640
For many of us, our generational curse is avoidance.

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:09,520
We come from people who just act like it didn't happen.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,700
But pain demands to be felt.

5
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:16,720
And somewhere along the line, a child will be born, whose charge it is to feel it all.

6
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:20,820
These are your shamans, your priests and priestesses, your healers.

7
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:27,860
You call them mental health patients and label their power as depression, anxiety, bipolar disorder and the like.

8
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:30,940
But these are the ones who are born with the gift of feeling.

9
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:35,180
And as we all know, you can't heal the pain that you refuse to feel.

